Enhanced SID Player (.mus player)
---------------------------------
The `sidplay` task (`src/tasks/dynamic/sidplay.inc`) is a port of the
Enhanced SID Player player routine.

Original: "Enhanced SID Player" by Craig Chamberlain (1986), published
in "COMPUTE!'s Music System for the C64 and C128" (COMPUTE!
Publications).

Disassembly: "ComputeSidPlayerC64Source" by Chris Zinn
(October-November 2025):
https://github.com/MyDeveloperThoughts/ComputeSidPlayerC64Source

Neither the 1986 original nor the 2025 disassembly carries an explicit
license. This component is included as a user-loadable music player;
redistribution is at the user's own discretion with respect to this
component.
